 "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: the prompt says the API validates the body against the schema model, but the ground truth's method has no RequestModels, so the model is never attached; attachment is not checked. ses_integration accepts a direct SES integration or a Lambda whose role grants ses:SendEmail; sendemail_template (detail) is what a Lambda proxy fails, because the prompt asks the integration itself to do the transform. Model schema accepted as object or JSON string. Resolved parameters are inlined, so stage_param and apikey_name_param show that a parameter has the stated default, not that the resource references it."
